 areas for improvement.\n* **Core Skills Training:** Step-by-step drills focusing on dink consistency, tactical positioning, and an introduction to stacking strategies.\n* **Guided Match Play:** Apply what you've learned in organized mini-games with real-time, personalized feedback.\n\n**Event Details:**\n\n* **Location:** Swing Star (5 Connie Crescent Unit 1, Vaughan, ON)\n* **Date \u0026 Time:** Every (Fri) 6-7pm\n* **Skill Level:** Beginner to Low-Intermediate\n* **Spots Available:** Strictly limited to 6-8 players to ensure quality coaching.\n* **Fee:** $20 (Covers court usage, practice balls, and instruction).\n* **Min-Max** Students: 3-6 (If there are fewer than 3 registrations, the amount paid via PayPal will be refunded via e-Transfer)\n* **Optional Extra Hour**: If you'd like to stay and play games after the 6-7 PM lesson, an additional hour (7-8 PM) is available for just **$5 per person**. This option is available if at least 4 players stay!","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/playtogether/events/316629514/","isSaved":false,"maxTickets":8,"rsvpState":"JOIN_APPROVAL","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535797979"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535797979"},"feeSettings":{"__typename":"EventFeeSettings","accepts":"PAYPAL","currency":"CAD","amount":20},"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":1,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:14329020"}}}]},"series":{"__typename":"Series","description":"Every week on Friday until February 23, 2027","weeklyRecurrence":{"__typename":"WeeklyRecurrenceInfo","weeklyDaysOfWeek":["FRIDAY"],"weeklyInterval":1},"monthlyRecurrence":null,"events({\"numberOfEvents\":5,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-02\"})":{"__typename":"SeriesEventConnection","edges":[{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316532386"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":{"__ref":"Event:316629514"}},{"__typename":"EventEdge","node":